// ---------------------------------------------------------------- Christmas ornaments
// GPOrnament (ornament.js) builds in a worker: a flat mesh disc (lattice + design as separate colored parts) and the
// two-part press that heat-forms it into half an ornament. A quick draft while controls move, then HD.
// Exports (colored 3MF with a filament per part, or a zip of STLs + README) come from an HD build, through the paywall.
TITLES.ornament = 'Christmas ornaments';
LEDES.ornament = 'Print a flat mesh disc with your design, warm it with a heat gun and press it into half an ornament with the printed press. Make two halves and click them together. For a photo ball that slips over a Christmas light, use Ornament ball (over a Christmas light).';
