  screws: 'Pan-head screws (#8 or 4 mm) into a wall, a desk or the inside of a case.',
  grid42: 'Stands upright in a 42 mm grid baseplate as a dock. Gravity holds it, so use it on a desk or in a drawer, not in a case that flips over.'
